    <briefdescription>
<para>PDU monitoring node — one supply rail: condition flags, window statistics, page packing (#216). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Fed one converted sample per scan (rail mV, current mA). Keeps:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>condition flags (PduRailFlag) with set persistence, clear persistence and hysteresis, so a brief blip neither raises nor drops a flag;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>window statistics for its PDU_RAIL_* page — average + minimum voltage, average current — reset each time the page is sent periodically;</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>the peak current for the PDU_STATUS page, reset each time that page is sent periodically. It is a FaultSource, so its worst condition reaches HEALTH_n.faultId through aggregateFaults().</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Hardware-free: the caller converts ADC counts (PduMath) and supplies the clock, so the logic is tested with injected values.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Static lifetime only (FaultSource registry rule) — construct as a global. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="copyright"><para>GPL-2.0-only — see Firmware/LICENSE </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
